# UNDERDELVE: the Old Lode's nest. Mo walks in from the keeper's rest along
# the hidden ledge; the Old Lode is already drifting overhead, and once Mo is
# inside the way back closes behind him. It takes 8 hits, and only while it
# sits on the floor after a slam. Beating it opens the east wall; the
# Sunstone wins the game (Saucer), and with all six lanterns still lit, the
# Alien too. After the ending, A goes back to the library.
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat room 6 0 250 40
wait 30
hold RIGHT 80
expect room_x == 7
expect boss_state == 0
expect sealed == 0
expect boss_hp == 8
hold RIGHT 40
expect sealed == 1
expect deaths == 0
press B
wait 20
expect boss_hp == 8
cheat boss_ground
cheat pos 60 130
hold RIGHT 48
press B
wait 20
expect boss_hp == 7
cheat boss_hp 1
press B
wait 20
expect boss_state == 5
wait 160
expect boss_dead == 1
expect sealed == 0
hold RIGHT 220
expect room_x == 0
hold RIGHT 92
hold RIGHT+A 3
hold RIGHT 60
expect state == 5
expect goals & 2
expect goals & 4
wait 250
press A
wait 60
expect_scene library
